MASTER TEST RUN chat #8, IN-026 (2 of 2): after the helper agreed, the
owner wrote in the same goal conversation „ჰკითხე მაიას ისიც, როდის
სცალია ბახვას ზარისთვის." and the run opened a new goal with its own
plan; the helper got a new conversation asking her when she was free.

An owner's line that tells us to ask a contact (contactInstructionIn),
on a conversation whose open goal has already asked somebody, is a
follow-up on that goal (D316: a person the owner names needs no plan).
That run does not hold create_task or propose_task_plan — no new words
to the model, the tools are not offered, as inviteHeld does. One read,
only when the line is such an instruction; it fails towards offering
the tools.

